(text "Traced from original board HYC-343-1 (2023/5/5) on 17 Oct 2026.\nButton matrix: R0/R1/R2 x GND/S1. Micro-switches: wire C + NO only, NC unconnected.\nEncoder common goes to +5V (not GND). D3, D4 are optional (DNP on original).\nU1 footprint: pitch 1.778 mm, rows 14 mm (paper-tested). All footprints measured from photo.\nVerify: encoder common leg, LED/C1 polarity, SW6 pads (see README)." (at 152.4 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1cf2f786-8c84-46ee-a432-40fc8620b901))

